From ecf42527eacdacba6b340a21648b0da16df2f827 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guildbound Dev <dev@guildbound.local>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 23:43:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0344: Blacksmith Crafting & Enhance art, Guild's Mood
 support

- New forge artwork for the Blacksmith's Crafting (gear) and Enhance stations, day/night pair each
- CraftingStation.tsx and EnhanceStation.tsx now route their background through backgroundSrc()/settings.backgroundMood, matching VendorsPanel's existing Guild's Mood support
- guild-idler-status.md updated with the patch 0344 entry
